        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 12368, Chic Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Chic Lever Mortise Lockset features a rectangular backplate combined with a rounded lever that will surely bring a contemporary feel to any space. Choose from a wide array of locking functions. The Chic Mortise Lockset is available in several modern finish colors. The Mortise Lock is built to withstand heavy use\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/chic-entryset-omnia-d12368\">Omnia D12368</a></p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Chic Entryset with Mortise Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 12368 Chic Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Chic Lever Mortise Lockset",
                "description": "The Chic Lever Mortise Lockset features a rectangular backplate combined with a rounded lever that will surely bring a contemporary feel to any space. Choose from a wide array of locking functions. The Chic Mortise Lockset is available in several modern finish colors. The Mortise Lock is built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design.\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-12368 Omnia Contemporary Lever Mortise Locksets, Omnia 12368 Mortise Locksets, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, omnia #368 levers, omnia 368 contemporary door levers, Chic Lever Mortise Locksets,"
